sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client<br/>(KServe / Caikit)
    participant Router as Router (Rust)<br/>8033/TCP gRPC<br/>Optional TLS/mTLS
    participant Validation as Request Validation
    participant Queue as Queue / Batcher
    participant Shard0 as Server Shard 0 (Master)<br/>Unix Domain Socket
    participant ShardN as Server Shards 1..N<br/>NCCL / NVLink
    participant K8s as Kubernetes kubelet
    participant HTTPServer as Router HTTP<br/>3000/TCP

    rect rgb(232, 244, 253)
        Note over Client,ShardN: Flow 1: Text Generation Request (Unary gRPC)
        Client->>Router: GenerationRequest (gRPC/8033)<br/>Optional TLS/mTLS, Optional client cert
        Router->>Validation: Validate request parameters<br/>(max tokens, sequence length)
        Validation->>Queue: Enqueue validated request
        Queue->>Queue: Dynamic batch construction<br/>(weight-based limits, prefill padding)
        Queue->>Shard0: Prefill RPC (gRPC over UDS)
        Shard0->>ShardN: Tensor parallel forward pass<br/>(NCCL shared memory / NVLink)
        ShardN-->>Shard0: Partial results
        loop Next Token Generation
            Queue->>Shard0: NextToken RPC (gRPC over UDS)
            Shard0->>ShardN: NCCL collective ops
            ShardN-->>Shard0: Partial results
        end
        Shard0-->>Queue: GenerationResponse
        Queue-->>Router: Completed result
        Router-->>Client: GenerationResponse (gRPC/8033)<br/>Optional TLS/mTLS
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over Client,ShardN: Flow 3: Streaming Text Generation
        Client->>Router: GenerateStream RPC (gRPC/8033)<br/>Optional TLS/mTLS, Optional client cert
        Router->>Validation: Validate request
        Validation->>Queue: Enqueue request
        Queue->>Shard0: Prefill RPC (gRPC over UDS)
        Shard0->>ShardN: Tensor parallel prefill<br/>(NCCL)
        ShardN-->>Shard0: Partial results
        loop Token-by-Token Streaming
            Queue->>Shard0: NextToken RPC (gRPC over UDS)
            Shard0->>ShardN: NCCL collective ops
            ShardN-->>Shard0: Partial results
            Shard0-->>Queue: Token result
            Queue-->>Router: Streamed token
            Router-->>Client: GenerationResponse (stream)<br/>gRPC/8033
        end
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over K8s,Shard0: Flow 2: Health Check
        K8s->>HTTPServer: GET /health (HTTP/3000)
        HTTPServer->>Shard0: Health RPC (gRPC over UDS)
        Shard0-->>HTTPServer: Health status
        HTTPServer-->>K8s: 200 OK / 503 Unavailable
    end
